{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51215","headline":"五言白话诗 二十二 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身如内架堂，（「内」，项楚校作「肉」。\n）命似堂中烛。\n风急吹烛灭，即是空堂屋。\n家贫无好衣，（自「家贫无好衣」以下，张锡厚作另一首。\n）造得一袄子。\n中心禳破毡，还将布作里。\n清贫常使乐，不用浊富贵。\n白日串项行，夜眠还作被。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}